# Browser
# Nova Pentacle's target is "of an opponent's choice" (CR 602.3): as Bot2 activates the Pentacle, Bot1's page is asked the
# target of an ability it does not control, and its caption says what the creature is for. Bot1 chooses its own Savannah
# Lions over its Sanctuary Cat. As the ability resolves Bot2 chooses Bot1's Sanctuary Cat as the source (CR 609.7a), and the
# effect is shown on the Lions, the creature it redirects to, and on the Cat, the source it watches.

